<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIJMANS 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>HEIJMANS 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>ROSMALEN, Netherlands 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.25 vs   2.00</p>
<p>    Net profit			    38.0  vs  32.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.90 vs   0.80</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.62 vs   1.52</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    55.8  vs  44.9</p>
<p>    Interest gains			 2.7  vs   6.1</p>
<p>    Tax				     20.06 vs  18.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Builder Heijmans NV previously said previously it</p>
<p>expected 1996 full-year net profits and sales to rise.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
